# Ownership of the verification surface (principle 09). These paths decide what
# the repository checks and how, so changing one is authorizing a change to the
# rules themselves. Pairing this with a branch ruleset that requires Code Owner
# review makes the authorization real: an agent can rewrite the code freely, but
# not weaken or delete a check to get a change through.
